# Closed-class words that never stand as a counted noun right after an hour:
# pronouns, adverbs and verb particles ("a las 8 te llamo").  Each word's class
# is quoted from its Wiktionary entry (https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/<word>); the
# fetched pages are kept with the audit.  Markup is removed from the quotes.
# me: Pronoun. "first-person singular objective direct personal pronoun; me"
# te: Pronoun. "(object pronoun) you (singular), thee"
# o: Pronoun. "him, it (as a direct object; as an indirect object, see lhe; after prepositions, see ele)"
# lhe: Pronoun. "inflection of ele,ela (dat): (to) him/her/it"
# nos: Pronoun. "inflection of nós (acc, dat)"
# vos: Pronoun. "inflection of vós (objective)"
# lhes: Pronoun. "inflection of eles,elas (indirect object)"
# se: Pronoun. "third-person singular and plural reflexive pronoun; himself; herself; itself; themselves"
me
te
o
lhe
nos
vos
lhes
se
